    "sentence_translations": [
      "",
      "Li Fei took out the watch and said to Little Mi, “Little Mi, I want to tell you…”",
      "",
      "“Driver! Quick!” Little Mi said to the driver.",
      "She wasn’t listening to Li Fei talk, she was thinking: There’s no time! My mom doesn’t like waiting for people.",
      "",
      "“Little Mi, I want to tell you …”",
      "",
      "“How long until we get to the movie theater?” Little Mi asked Li Fei.",
      "",
      "“Huh? What? 7–8 minutes.” Li Fei said, “I want to show you…Ah!”",
      "Li Fei took out the watch hoping to show Little Mi, but the watch flew out of the taxi.",
      "",
      "“Driver, stop the car! Stop the car!” Li Fei started yelling.",
      "",
      "Little Mi asked, “What happened?”",
      "",
      "“My watch flew out, the one that my mom gave me.",
      "I must find the watch. Stay here and wait for me a while, just a minute, I’ll be back soon.”",
      "Li Fei got out of the taxi to look for the watch.",
      "",
      "Not long after, Li Fei found the watch, and returned to the taxi.",
      "He said to the driver, “I found it! Let’s go!”"
    ]
